		<VersionNumber>9.1.2.8</VersionNumber>
		<Name>C Dump</Name>
		<Author>CNC machine</Author>
		<Comment>For small/medium waves & laguna\nSort of replica of the CI Dumpster Diver\nNo 3d layers feel free to download and change to your dimensions\n\nDumpster Diver is a lively step down with wider nose and tail, extra nose/tail rocker, and a subtle single concave. It planes fast, builds speed easily, and pivots tight in the pocket while holding when it’s steeper. Thruster setup. Works from knee-high mush to double-overhead across beachbreaks, points, and reefs.</Comment>
		<User>Thomas Vilmin</User>
